From: Satoshi Nakamoto <hello@chadwallet.xyz>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 09:32:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(browse): record the CLI's binary version in the daemon
 state file

The daemon runs under `bun run server.ts`, so readVersionHash() looked for
.version beside bun and found nothing; binaryVersion was null and the CLI's
"binary updated, restarting server" check never fired. The CLI now passes
its own version to the spawned server in BROWSE_BINARY_VERSION, and the
server prefers it when writing binaryVersion.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UqE4YXZEbSiTp3NaMyH6dV
